\[\mathcal{L}_{qcd} = \underbrace{i\overline{\psi}\gamma^{\mu}(\partial_{\mu}-igA_{\mu} )\psi}_{1.}-\underbrace{m\overline{\psi}\psi}_{2.}-\underbrace{1}_{4} \underbrace{F^{a}_{\mu\nu}F^{\mu\nu}_{a}}_{3.}\] (I.6)

